/xhocquet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xhocquet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xhocquet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xhocquet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xhocquet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xhocquet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xhocquet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xhocquet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xhocquet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115240#pullrequestreview-3693314246","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115240","author_association":"NONE","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115240#pullrequestreview-3693314246"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115240"}},"submitted_at":"2026-01-22T16:15:26Z","commit_id":"bbcbbd91fbdbdf72d2ac5e5fc6fab2b745890c7a"},{"id":3695234735,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7cQM6v","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally, it still causes dozens of errors to be printed when loading a scene with ReflectionProbes:\r\n\r\n```\r\nERROR: Condition \"format.mipmaps < 1\" is true. Returning: RID()\r\n   at: texture_create (./servers/rendering/rendering_device.cpp:932)\r\nERROR: Attempted to name invalid ID: 0\r\n   at: set_resource_name (./servers/rendering/rendering_device.cpp:6472)\r\n```\r\n\r\nHowever, it no longer crashes in both Forward+ and Mobile.\r\n\r\nAlso, visually, it looks pretty odd on ReflectionProbes as things will remain reflective even with `roughness = 1.0`:\r\n\r\n### 1 roughness layer\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/98bfbd4a-e0e4-4a34-9d1c-92cb3ea1d220\r\n\r\n### 2 roughness layers\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/97384190-b160-4ca9-b860-ef52b1f1046e\r\n\r\n### 7 roughness layers (default)\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/09ae8d9f-bc26-4fb5-9c4f-bcf59dd759dc\r\n\r\nIt gets even worse with ambient light from reflection probes (not shown in the above videos, as I'm using LightmapGI):\r\n\r\n1 roughness layer | 2 roughness layers | 7 roughness layers\r\n-|-|-\r\n<img width=\"1180\" height=\"783\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/91eaa2d8-fed5-4704-9020-3b9dc06645a3\" /> | <img width=\"1180\" height=\"783\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1ecb873d-4993-4140-ba52-2d7081966afb\" /> | <img width=\"1180\" height=\"783\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/27531fe6-30ca-4a13-9bb8-fb62635dd9ec\" />\r\n\r\nWe may want to clamp the lowest number of roughness layers to 2 to avoid this. To do, we'd modify the project settings hint, but also clamp in the RenderingServer setter in case an old project set it to `1`.","state":"COMMENTED","html_u